": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2018-01-13T11:00:31Z", "updated_at": "2018-07-09T09:04:07Z", "closed_at": "2018-06-01T01:15:30Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "This is about proposal of **DroneCore shell**, a command line tool for interacting with a MAVLink device using DroneCore library. Its will be a handy tool for both users & developers.\nMay be this was discussed sometime back in the community. I am just recording it here for tracking later.\n\nI feel that its very suitable, if someone wants to try DroneCore quickly like,\n```\n$ dronecore action { arm | disarm | takeoff | land} [args]\n```\n```\n$ dronecore mission { upload | download | set | } [args]\n```\netc.\n\nI imagine that such tools are going to become familiar with many users in future, as we see such powerful tools like **curl**/**wget** in URL transfer domain. I think with similar thought _mavros_ command line (`mavcmd`) was introduced ( I think so).\n\nAfter python bindings in place, we may think of developing such tools relatively easily.\nI shared this with @julianoes earlier. I just wanted to hear what is the feedback in the community.\n\nPlease share your thoughts.\nThanks.", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/224/reactions", "total_count": 2, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/224/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/357601217", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/224#issuecomment-357601217", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/224", "id": 357601217, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1NzYwMTIxNw==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_even